title: Start
---
[b]Swipe left/right to look around.[/b]
[b]Swipe up to move forward.[/b]
[b]Swipe down to open your phone.[/b]
===

title: Story1
---
<<set_enabled_in_unity PeekoHatch true>>
<<wait 3>>
<<set_enabled_in_unity PeekoHatch false>>
<<set_enabled_in_unity BedTamagotchi true>>
The egg hatches and there it is, your new friend.
Hi! I'm Peeko, your new best friend!
You can play with me, talk with me and I'll always be there for you!

Hi, I'm glad to meet you! 
We are going to have so much fun together!

You're feeling a little excited

Hi Peeko, I'm happy to have you as a friend, 
but what can I really do with you?

I'll show you around!
Click on the Burger icon to head to the kitchen.

In the top left corner, you can see how hungry I am. 
You will have to feed me when I get hungry. Let's try it out!
===

title: Story2
---
With a mouthful Hmmh Thank you! I loveee burgers

After Peeko is done eating suddenly it's happiness is low.

Oh no Peeko, What is wrong? Please don't be sad! 
How can I make you happy?

You can play with me to make me happy...

Go to the play room and play a game with me.
===

title: Story3
---
Yay! Thank you, I had so much fun!

Me too, Peeko! I'm a little tired now, So, I'll rest for a bit. But after that we can play again!

Aww, okay, take a good rest!

Put your phone away and start heading towards your bed.
